########################################################################
# .gitignore for the PUBLIC repo jpazvd/un-data-commons-spotlight.
# Maintained in the private repo and copied by sync-to-public. Edit there.
# Strategy: ignore everything, then allow what belongs in public. It mirrors
# .github/public-whitelist.txt (JP, 4 Nov 2026: published Spotlights, and the code that rebuilds them).
########################################################################
*
!.gitignore
!README.md
!LICENSE
!LICENSE-CONTENT.md
!CITATION.cff
!*/
!/spotlights/[0-9]*/**
!/scripts/*.py
!/templates/**
!requirements.txt
!package.json
!package-lock.json
*.log
*.render.html
__pycache__/
node_modules/
# Defense in depth: never public
.github/
internal/
drafts/
notes/
.env*
